{"title":"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_15\">Problem 15</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 15\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is the remainder when each of the numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/8/b287f08d6f2b1b53059dae066f91c7ad6f87e9c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1059,~1417$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"86\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/c/59c505c4c55a1380eeb3cadc2a9fe47932c02221.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2312$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> is divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is an integer greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/9/b797037ecb8d3c7f8654cb669d6498430dcf9930.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d-r$\" width=\"39\" height=\"12\" /> equals \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/c/54c11a2d210e3336ea28f18c9fe834df6a39197d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }1\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }15\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }179\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }d-15\\qquad  \\textbf{(E) }d-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"452\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We are given these congruences:\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/0/170f066e38c088653b2597e44e9980b3d4b03896.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1059 \\equiv r \\pmod{d} \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"177\" height=\"20\" /> (i)</center>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/b/2cb69c85eef250e85dec2aeef4578e59c735f228.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1417 \\equiv r \\pmod{d} \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"177\" height=\"20\" /> (ii)</center>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/b/34be5ab4060e3f47479db32d51cc629594eb4315.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2312 \\equiv r \\pmod{d} \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"177\" height=\"20\" /> (iii)</center>\n<p><br />\nLet's make a new congruence by subtracting (i) from (ii), which results in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/0/60021684ebea056f3d6f35f7cc4fce108af364a9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[358 \\equiv 0 \\pmod{d}.\\]\" width=\"146\" height=\"18\" />\nSubtract (ii) from (iii) to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/2/4b24db91815a43023bf753d47932c226d93349d6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[895 \\equiv 0 \\pmod{d}.\\]\" width=\"146\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><br />\nNow we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/9/ca91ac153a72ad54194b08bda66a0d551bc03e94.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$358$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/d/7dd0f69e4cda7b0ef2501ffc1c27b00b4933dc7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$895$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> are both multiples of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Their prime factorizations are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/7/e9717339a6412028d797b75121bd2af1f25351ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$358=2 \\cdot 179$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"103\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/1/eb19f23977c49441c3ec94c4b0b3f003990f48dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$895=5 \\cdot 179$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"103\" height=\"14\" />, so their common factor is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/5/2b578e21439895ecf647228d2d1089fc5c7d59e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$179$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />, which means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/a/53ac7b75461a6bc007f5421dc8a5bfdf34ee31d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d=179$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nPlug <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/a/53ac7b75461a6bc007f5421dc8a5bfdf34ee31d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d=179$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" /> back into any of the original congruences to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/1/e3118b5b126074c8785e471973b5ebbafab1b542.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r=164$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"62\" height=\"14\" />. Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/a/afac1ec2bd5d3f03ccb59fa968fc258f20ab86b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d-r=179-164= \\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"232\" height=\"30\" />. ~<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:Jiang147369\" title=\"User:Jiang147369\">jiang147369</a>\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME\" title=\"1976 AHSME\">1976 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1976 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1976\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title